oofem.sm.out
2D inclusion eigendisplacement: steel + ITZ + matrix (mechanical, elastic)
NonLinearStatic nsteps 100 nmodules 1 rtolv 1.e-3 stiffMode 1 maxiter 200 controllmode 1 profileopt 1
vtkxmllattice primvars 1 1 cellvars 6 138 139 140 156 157 158 tstep_step 1
domain 2dLattice
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 3 nmat 3 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 2 nset 2
latticecs 1 material 1
latticecs 2 material 2
latticecs 3 material 3
latticelinearelastic 1 d 0. talpha 0. calpha 0. e 30.e9 a1 1.0 bio 1.0
latticelinearelastic 2 d 0. talpha 0. calpha 0. e 200.e9 a1 0.3333
latticelinearelastic 3 d 0. talpha 0. e 200.e9 a1 0.001 calpha 0.5e-4
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 2 6 values 2 0. 0. set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 2 1 6 values 2 0. 0. set 2
StructTemperatureLoad 3 loadTimeFunction 2 Components 1 1.0
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
PiecewiseLinFunction 2 nPoints 2 t 2 0. 100. f(t) 2 0. 1.
Set 1 nodes 1 #@CTL1
Set 2 nodes 2 #@CTL2 #@CTL3
